# RUNG 9b — the two edge-rasteriser blobs
# ============================================================================================
# Source of record: kernel/shaders/edge_setup.s and kernel/shaders/edge_cov.s.
# ⭐ Every dword below is byte-verified by TWO INDEPENDENT ASSEMBLERS — llvm-mc -mcpu=gfx90c and
# mabda's encoder driven through tests/gpu/edgeasm.cyr's label/fixup pass (58/58 and 133/133).
# That diff covers all SEVEN resolved branches, which is the part hand-assembly cannot check:
# a dropped VOP3 or FLAT hi dword shifts everything after it and yields a wrong PICTURE, not a
# fault. Regenerate with edgeasm, never by hand.
